A||||7||firstfiero||Raced a Porsche 944..||||14||
Z||000000||firstfiero||06-06-2001||09:38 PM||||    On my way to work today I was driving down a two lane one way street. I had swerved in and out of some traffic to get in front and was cruising about 40 when I look in my rear view and see the front end of a silver Porshe 944...he's coming up on me fast and as he gets closer I see it's a young kid. So I pop 2nd and floor it as he gets in the other lane. Now were side by side doing 55...65...75...****  it's buried. and were still accelerating side by side. finnaly we see a light turn red. As we come to a stop I rev her up to see what he has off the line. Instead he puts his window down and Says  "damn, I didn't think a fiero could keep up with me"..."she's not the fastest on the street but shes quick enough for me!"..."Well my cars slow of the line so I don't want to race you"..."That's cool,your car is sweet!!"...and with that the light changed and we pulled off. Good kid...class act! I wish more of the kids today could be cool like that win or lose. Anyway it was the first race I had in a while so I thought I would pass it on. Anybody out their race a 944 off the line...Is a stock 86se v6 faster of the line? <P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||spideyfoot||06-06-2001||10:05 PM||||944 <BR>82-85 143 sae @5800<BR>86-89 147 SAE @5800<BR>944 TURBO<BR>86-88 217 SAE @5800<BR>88-89 TURBO S 247@6000<BR>944 S 86-88 188 @ 6000<BR>944 S2 89- 208@5800<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||06-06-2001||10:52 PM||||A non-turbo 944 has roughly the same horsepower but more weight. A kid down the street use to have a non-turbo and he never had a chance.||||reg||1
Z||000003||ChadMan||06-07-2001||09:08 AM||||My 86 SE 4-sp was quite a bit quicker off the line than my buddy's non-turbo 944.  But I bet he had a little more top speed...I was with him when he hit an indicated 130 once and I don't think the SE would have done that.<P>Nice race, firstfiero.||||reg||1
Z||000004||spideyfoot||06-07-2001||10:05 AM||||944 o to 60 8.3 sec top speed 130. ( early model factory spec)<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Wannabe||06-07-2001||04:48 PM||||I have an '88 Formula and an '86 944. You would have a hard time telling the difference in accelleration without running side by side. The 944 has better top end though, the Fiero pulls evenly throughout the range, each one my have an advantage depending on what speed you start the race.||||reg||1
Z||000006||88formula||06-07-2001||04:51 PM||||I raced a 944 and he destroyed me. He must have had forced induction or something.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||KnightRyder31||06-07-2001||08:59 PM||||The late 80s model Turbo S 944 5-speed would beat any stock Fiero.<BR>I test drove one, and boy are they quick.<BR>I had it going like 90MPH in 4th and still had a good amount of juice left before I would have to shift into 5th.<BR>||||reg||1
